 {"type": "example", "content": "You may want to place another order. "}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Talking about Wishes and Imaginary Situations "}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use <span class=\"italic\">\u201cI wish ... \u201d</span> to talk about things you do not have or do, or you cannot have or do."}, {"type": "text", "content": "The verb <span class=\"italic\">wish</span> introduces an idea. After <span class=\"italic\">wish</span>, you use a verb in the past tense."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I wish I knew ... <br/>I wish I had ... <br/>I wish you were ... "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Structure: <br/>Wish + Simple Past tense"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Example</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Meaning</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I wish they put signs on backdoors.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I want them to put signs on backdoors, but they don't.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I wish our manager told us things like this.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I want our manager to tell us things like this, but she doesn't.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I wish I worked somewhere else.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I want to work somewhere else, but I don't.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to get by"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to manage or succeed in doing something with difficulty"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "c