 {"type": "skill", "content": "Writing"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Speaking"}], "type": "learning_skills"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self Assessment."}], "type": "post_instructions"}]}], "type": "scholar", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}], "stimuli": [{"contents": [{}], "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "id": 0, "template_override": 1}, {"contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn7le07ob10re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "text": "", "id": 0, "image": "engenn7le07ob10re2img02.jpg"}, {"time": "100", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Harald</span>:  Hello mate!  Is this the backdoor of Bistro 88? I wish they put signs on backdoors. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Tom</span>:  Yes, it is. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Harald</span>: Great, I've got a large food delivery to drop off. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Tom</span>:  I didn't know we were expecting a delivery today. I wish our manager told us things like this. She ought to inform us about deliveries. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Harald</span>: Well, you see here?  I have it on my delivery schedule. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Tom</span>:  Ok, carry on then. You could take the food over there.", "id": 1, "image": "engenn7le07ob10re2img02.jpg"}, {"time": "27500", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Harald</span>:   I've got milk, cheese, bacon and coffee. I guess it's for breakfast. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Tom</span>:  Do you have eggs? We barely have enough eggs to get by. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Harald</span>: Yup, I've got 20 cartons of eggs. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Tom</span>:  What about butter? <br/><span class=\"strong\">Harald</span>: No, no butter. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Tom</span>: I wish you had butter. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Harald</span>: You may want to place another order.", "id": 2, "image": "engenn7le07ob10re2img01.jpg"}, {"time": "48000", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Tom</span>:  Ok. I'm Tom, by the way. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Harald</span>:  Pleased to meet you, Tom. Harald here. Nice to come across some nice folk once in awhile. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Tom</span>: Oh, everyone at Bistro 88 is quite nice, except maybe our manager Vanessa. She's a tough one to figure out.  We have to deal with some interesting situations, I can tell you that. I wish I worked somewhere else. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Harald</span>: Well, everyone has to bring home the bacon, my good boy!", "id": 3, "image": "engenn7le07ob10re2img03.jpg"}], "coverimg": "engenn7le07ob10re2img02.jpg"}}], "id": 1, "template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "_data": [], "title": ""}], "id": 0}]}